Assessed targets: current main commit 6143ab66116f73ccccd94ab207ce85db6bdb0d50; released product mongodb\-mcp\-server@3.2.2 (commit 0af7e43bd2c8d0188644b355bbc25da8c7c62d98). Ticket created 2026\-10\-06. Recommendation only; final decision remains with the reviewer.
{anchor:mongodb-vulnerability-auto-triage-v1-release-4a536aa050a2ad4b053ea68c02436bad3c01397867d2318564e3e8b99d5818e8}

*Current main: likely not affected.* Confidence: high. Grounding: unaffected-version. Likely not affected. Current main pins @simple\-git/argv\-parser 2.0.1, outside the advisory's affected range (<2.0.1), reached only through dev\-only simple\-git 4.0.2 in the private packages/scripts and packages/accuracy\-tests workspaces. The shipped server package has no dependency path to it. The ticket's 1.1.1 does not resolve in this target at all.

Assessed targets: current main commit 6143ab66116f73ccccd94ab207ce85db6bdb0d50; released product mongodb\-mcp\-server@3.2.2 (commit 0af7e43bd2c8d0188644b355bbc25da8c7c62d98). Ticket created 2026\-10\-06. Recommendation only; final decision remains with the reviewer.
{anchor:mongodb-vulnerability-auto-triage-v1-main-2c15f6b5c10e0568a44e33b803782e7d84b53d9402d07a108eb46a014c5966e1}

